  m_Name: Conversation_OfficerAda
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafeStreets.Conversation
  speakerName: Officer Ada
  lines:
  - Hi! I'm Officer Ada. I keep this street safe.
  - 'Remember: before you cross, STOP at the curb and look both ways.'
  - //Officer Ada
  - "Cross only at the zebra stripes \u2014 and never chase a ball into the road!"
  closingTip: Stop. Look. Listen. Then cross with a grown-up.
